{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/sourceprotocol\/set(readytime:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceProtocol"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceProtocol\/set(readyTime:)"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a source to be dispatched when the given monotonic time is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reached (or passed)."}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"set"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"readyTime","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gint64","text":"gint64"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GLib","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"externalID":"s:4GLib14SourceProtocolPAAE3set9readyTimeys5Int64V_tF","title":"set(readyTime:)"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"set"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"readyTime","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gint64","text":"gint64"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the monotonic time is in the past (as it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always will be if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"readyTime"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":") then the source will be","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dispatched immediately."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"readyTime"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-1"},{"text":" then the source is never woken up on the basis","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of the passage of time.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dispatching the source does not reset the ready time.  You should do","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so yourself, from the source dispatch function."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that if you have a pair of sources where the ready time of one","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suggests that it will be delivered first but the priority for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other suggests that it would be delivered first, and the ready time"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for both sources is reached during the same main context iteration,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then the order of dispatch is undefined.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a no-op to call this function on a [struct"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source"},{"type":"text","text":"] which has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already been destroyed with [method"},{"code":"GLib.Source.destroy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"].","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This API is only intended to be used by implementations of [struct","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"]."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Do not call this API on a [struct","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"] that you did not create."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","title":"GLib","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glib","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/SourceProtocol":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SourceProtocol","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SourceProtocol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceProtocol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GSource"},{"type":"text","text":" struct is an opaque data type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"representing an event source."}],"url":"\/documentation\/glib\/sourceprotocol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SourceProtocol","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/Source":{"url":"\/documentation\/glib\/source","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GSource"},{"text":" struct is an opaque data type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"representing an event source.","type":"text"}],"title":"Source","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Source"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Source"}]},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/SourceProtocol/set(readyTime:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"set","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"readyTime"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"gint64","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gint64"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/G